  · simp only [Matrix.map_add f (map_add f), Matrix.map_mul, hz, hρ, h3, smul_add, Matrix.mul_smul, Matrix.smul_mul]
  · simp only [Matrix.map_neg f (map_neg f), Matrix.transpose_map, hz, h4, smul_neg, Matrix.transpose_smul]
